{"4245380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Shaman Diary", "steam_appid": 4245380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malo, a young man from the capital, never knew his father, a man who left for Karrodim just before he was born.  <br>Driven by a longing for truth and adventure, he begins a journey across a world filled with mysteries, dangers, and secrets. <br> <br>Explore a rich heroic-fantasy universe inspired by an <strong>original 650-page novel</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet memorable allies, travel through multiple continents and villages, and confront the threats lurking in the shadows of this vast world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245380/extras/8abd108838996a49cfb9bbb3aa3d5294.avif?t=1788291669\" width=1000 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be ready for:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A branching story</strong> where your decisions impact your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cast of endearing companions</strong> who may help you… or complicate your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic turn-based combat</strong> with meaningful choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging bosses</strong> demanding smart tactics and careful planning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side quests, leveling, gear, skills</strong>… everything you expect from a <strong>classic old-school RPG</strong>  <br>  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam-deck support:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several games have been played internally and by the community on Steam Deck, and no issues have been reported. The recommended controller configuration should work correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malo, a young man from the capital, never knew his father, a man who left for Karrodim just before he was born.  <br>Driven by a longing for truth and adventure, he begins a journey across a world filled with mysteries, dangers, and secrets. <br> <br>Explore a rich heroic-fantasy universe inspired by an <strong>original 650-page novel</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet memorable allies, travel through multiple continents and villages, and confront the threats lurking in the shadows of this vast world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245380/extras/8abd108838996a49cfb9bbb3aa3d5294.avif?t=1788291669\" width=1000 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be ready for:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A branching story</strong> where your decisions impact your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cast of endearing companions</strong> who may help you… or complicate your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic turn-based combat</strong> with meaningful choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging bosses</strong> demanding smart tactics and careful planning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side quests, leveling, gear, skills</strong>… everything you expect from a <strong>classic old-school RPG</strong>  <br>  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam-deck support:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several games have been played internally and by the community on Steam Deck, and no issues have been reported. The recommended controller configuration should work correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "short_description": "A story-driven turn-based RPG with deep stra